  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 16,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Status across all sites,\"",
        "line": 26
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 49,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Recommendation for Second Coming deployment?\"",
        "line": 71
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 51,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Nephilim-class suppression forces. Genetic engineering optimized for high-resilience biological management. Consciousness-disruption capabilities exceeding current Reptilian specifications. Estimated requirement: ten thousand units distributed across all sites. Alternative: psychological warfare continuation, await indigenous self-suppression through implanted division protocols before deploying military assets.\"",
        "line": 74
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 55,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Flag all sites for Second Coming priority completion,\"",
        "line": 80
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 69,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This pattern,\"",
        "line": 102
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 71,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The First Tongue,\"",
        "line": 105
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 72,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Nephoretti taught us fragments of this,\"",
        "line": 107
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 77,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"When they leave,\"",
        "line": 115
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 80,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Orbital mechanics suggest departure within eight cycles. They cannot remain indefinitely\u2014their vessel follows gravitational trajectories that don't permit extended planetary position.\"",
        "line": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 82,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"To continue their work?\"",
        "line": 123
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 83,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"To serve as permanent garrison. To maintain the structures they've built. To...\"",
        "line": 125
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 87,
      "actor": "Torhh",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Nephoretti,\"",
        "line": 131
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 88,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And when you understood?\"",
        "line": 133
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 89,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We built the Garden together. Five hundred years of cooperation that transformed both our peoples. We became something neither could have achieved alone.\"",
        "line": 135
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 95,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I would like that,\"",
        "line": 144
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 96,
      "actor": "Torhh",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we will try,\"",
        "line": 146
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 128,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Departure authorization,\"",
        "line": 193
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 130,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Acknowledged. Flagging indigenous biological management as priority deployment for next convergence. Recommend Nephilim-class assets: genetic engineering optimized for stone-flesh combat, consciousness-disruption capabilities, sufficient quantity for complete suppression.\"",
        "line": 196
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 131,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Approved. Additionally: monitor psychological warfare effectiveness through remote Needle sensor arrays. Document tribal fragmentation progression. Assess optimal timing for Second Coming deployment based on indigenous self-suppression metrics.\"",
        "line": 198
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 138,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Efficient,\"",
        "line": 210
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 140,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And the slaves we leave behind?\"",
        "line": 213
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 141,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Igigi will continue breeding, maintaining infrastructure, planting psychological weapons they don't know they carry. The Reptilians will provide basic security, prevent indigenous populations from destroying what we've built. Neither species requires our continued presence\u2014they're tools that operate autonomously once properly programmed.\"",
        "line": 215
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 151,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The indigenous biologicals will celebrate our departure,\"",
        "line": 229
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 153,
      "actor": "Eduhauana",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Let them believe it,\"",
        "line": 232
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 154,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And three thousand cycles from now?\"",
        "line": 234
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 155,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We return to find them fractured. Weakened. Fighting each other over resources and territories and grievances they can no longer trace to their source. We deploy Nephilim forces, complete the network, and reduce this world from contested to controlled status with minimal additional resource expenditure.\"",
        "line": 236
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 175,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"They left us,\"",
        "line": 268
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 176,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You are free,\"",
        "line": 270
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 180,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Free to maintain their infrastructure,\"",
        "line": 276
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 181,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Do you hate us?\"",
        "line": 278
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 186,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I do not hate,\"",
        "line": 285
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 194,
      "actor": "Torhh",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Sundering,\"",
        "line": 295
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 200,
      "actor": "Pazuzu",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We build anyway,\"",
        "line": 304
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 201,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"It will take lifetimes,\"",
        "line": 306
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 203,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then we spend lifetimes countering them. Three thousand cycles before they return? That's time enough to build genuine unity despite manufactured division. Time enough to prove that consciousness can overcome programming through persistent choice.\"",
        "line": 309
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 211,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And when they return?\"",
        "line": 319
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 212,
      "actor": "Torhh",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"When they return,\"",
        "line": 321
      }
    }
  ],
